 1. if/else as a value                     -> 1
 2. case/when as a value                   -> "two"
 3. begin...end as a value                 -> 42
 4. while loop as a value                  -> nil; with `break 5` -> 5
hi
 5. x = (puts "hi") leaves x =             -> nil
 6. def greet; end evaluates to            -> :greet
 7. class Foo; 99; end evaluates to        -> 99; an empty class body -> nil
 8. chained x = y = 1 gives [x, y]         -> [1, 1]
 9. nested y = (a = 1) gives [y, a]        -> [1, 1]
10. lambda body with two statements        -> 2
11. eval("1 + 2")                          -> 3
12. eval("x = 1; x + 1")                   -> 2
13. class ...; private def helper; end     -> [:helper]  (private received the Symbol)
